# Lyra Dawnbringer: "Other Angels you control get +1/+1 and have lifelink." Bot1's Youthful Valkyrie (an Angel) and then Lyra herself
# are cast. The Valkyrie (1/3, +1/+1 counter from its own trigger when Lyra enters) gets lifelink and +1/+1 from Lyra, so 3/5; Lyra has her own printed flying, first strike and lifelink; Bot1's
# Llanowar Elves (not an Angel) gets nothing, and neither does Bot2's Youthful Valkyrie (an Angel, but not one Bot1
# controls). CR 613.1f, 702.15.

